.notice { padding: 9px 11px; background: color-mix(in srgb, CanvasText 8%, Canvas); border-radius: 6px; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;body&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;A brighter dark mode and more terminal fonts&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This update brings build details, update controls, and license notices together in Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find build and update details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Open Preferences → About to see the running version and build, macOS version, last update check, automatic installation settings, and license notices.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choose a font installed on your Mac&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;In Preferences → Terminal, pick System Monospace, select an installed font family, or enter a custom family. Save to apply the font to open terminals.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use a brighter dark appearance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Preferences, the sidebar, and terminals use lighter dark backgrounds. The initial General tab no longer gets a forced focus ring.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active SSH, SFTP, and local shell sessions before installing. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.0.2"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
